<title>ISRAEL: Woman shoots Israeli at Jordan border - radio.</title>
<headline>Woman shoots Israeli at Jordan border - radio.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM 1997-04-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A woman traveller crossing into the Israeli-ruled West Bank from Jordan shot and wounded an Israeli security man on Sunday during a routine border check at the Allenby bridge, Israel radio said.</p>
<p>The radio said the traveller had passed a Jordanian checkpoint before crossing the Jordan river to the Israeli border post. It provided no further details.</p>
</text>
